{"name":"Stiletto Love","hex":"#b6453e","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"stiletto","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small, slender knife or dagger-like weapon intended for stabbing.","A rapier."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To attack or kill with a stiletto (dagger)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/stiletto"},{"term":"love","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A deep caring for the existence of another.","Strong affection."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To have a strong affection for (someone or something).","To need, thrive on."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/love"}],"entries":[{"title":"Stiletto","blocks":[{"text":"A stiletto is a specialized dagger with a long slender blade and needle-like point, primarily intended as a thrusting and stabbing weapon."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stiletto"},{"title":"Love","blocks":[{"text":"Love encompasses a range of strong and positive emotional and mental states, from the most sublime virtue or good habit, the deepest interpersonal affection, to the simplest pleasure. An example of this range of meanings is that the love of a mother differs from the love of a spouse, which differs from the love for food. Most commonly, love refers to a feeling of strong attraction and emotional attachment."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Gunners_stiletto_01.jpg/500px-Gunners_stiletto_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Gunners_stiletto_01.jpg/500px-Gunners_stiletto_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Stiletto","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGunners_stiletto_01.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/16th_century_stiletto.JPG/500px-16th_century_s